\newlabel{tab:cross_cwm}{{6}{6}{Cross-model comparison of CWM repo-level unparseable rates. The 41pp gap (93\% vs.\ 52\%) is statistically significant ($p{<}0.001$, Fisher's exact test), demonstrating that CWM failure severity is model/tokenizer-dependent}{table.caption.12}{}}
